WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.650
I'm standing here with Ross Rebagliati.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.600
Ross is a gold medal skiboarder.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.150
And Ross, you claim you can teach me

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:08.830
to master the board today.

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:10.750
Not a problem, Conan, we're gonna do it.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.857
I don't like speed.
(audience laughing)

00:00:13.857 --> 00:00:15.870
And I don't like to fall.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.270
I'm not a big fan of snow

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:18.970
or cold weather.
(audience laughing)

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:20.628
Snowboarding's your sport, Conan.

00:00:20.628 --> 00:00:21.461
(audience laughing)

00:00:21.461 --> 00:00:22.294
You think so?
Absolutely.

00:00:22.294 --> 00:00:24.010
You're very positive, I like that.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:25.250
I have a custom board.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.302
My nickname is The Cone-Dog.

00:00:27.302 --> 00:00:28.590
(audience laughing)
Okay, that's sweet.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.110
For Conan, see how that works?

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.008
Oh yeah, right,

00:00:31.008 --> 00:00:31.841
yeah.
You,

00:00:31.841 --> 00:00:32.674
yeah.
Good one.

00:00:32.674 --> 00:00:35.200
And then look at this guy down here.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.410
That's me.
Aww!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.221
I put the little teeth in,
(audience clapping)

00:00:39.221 --> 00:00:41.830
and I'm wearing a scarf 'cause it's cold.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:43.529
And I don't know why
I'm wearing a nightcap.

00:00:43.529 --> 00:00:44.860
(audience laughing)
I just, I'm kinda mad

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.250
at the guy who did this 'cause I wanted it

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.390
to be more ski wear, and it looks like

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:48.260
I'm going to sleep.
(audience laughing)

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:49.660
[Ross] I like your ears.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.970
What's, like that, that bunny
ears on the top, what that?

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:53.949
Oh, right up here?
Yeah,

00:00:53.949 --> 00:00:54.782
what's those?
Yeah, he's the dog.

00:00:54.782 --> 00:00:56.230
That's the Cone-Dog.
That's the dog part,

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.267
okay, I see.
Yeah.

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:58.100
We got the canine's-
Cone-Dog.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.350
And the ears, I see.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:02.510
And then to intimidate my
opponents, check this out.

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:03.540
You're gonna love this.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:06.170
When I go for the big jump.
Nice.

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:07.369
Look at that, when I go way up

00:01:07.369 --> 00:01:08.202
into the air.
(audience laughing)

00:01:08.202 --> 00:01:09.035
(audience applauding)
(audience cheering)

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:11.244
"You suck," right in the guy's face.

00:01:11.244 --> 00:01:13.669
Then I grab the clip and
I show him my ass pad,

00:01:13.669 --> 00:01:15.053
and then right down.
(audience laughing)

00:01:15.053 --> 00:01:17.120
When you're learning to initiate a turn,

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:20.060
you kind of want to kind of
like slide your back foot around

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:21.177
like this, right?
Right.

00:01:21.177 --> 00:01:22.010
That creates-
So the back foot

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:23.970
is the rudder sort of.
Kind of like a rudder.

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.150
Yes.
So it kinda

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:26.070
tilts your board that way.
(audience laughing)

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:28.180
You don't want to knock
the boards down the hill.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.340
But I just knocked your board downhill.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.024
You want to keep your knees flexible.

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:33.040
Flexible.
You don't want to be stiff.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:34.827
You want to be able to absorb everything.

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:35.660
Right.

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:36.950
All right.
You gotta be kinda loose.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:38.210
Loose.
Right, okay.

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.770
Okay, hands in front.

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:40.795
All right.
Hands in front,

00:01:40.795 --> 00:01:41.628
you know you kinda-
And it's kind of

00:01:41.628 --> 00:01:43.540
a Zen thing, right, like-
Yeah, right, surfing.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.740
It's very much I am one with
what's happening around me

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.680
and anything that happens is okay.

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:50.190
Whatever happens is cool,

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:51.023
'cause that's-
Exactly.

00:01:51.023 --> 00:01:53.279
Just the way it is, dude,
that's just the way it is.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.112
Right.
(audience laughing)

00:01:54.112 --> 00:01:55.210
(Conan grunting)
(boot clicking)

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:57.207
Son of a bitch!
(boot thudding)

00:01:57.207 --> 00:01:58.530
(audience laughing)
(Ross chuckling)

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:01.619
(Conan exhaling heavily)

00:02:01.619 --> 00:02:02.452
I don't know what happened there,

00:02:02.452 --> 00:02:04.889
