00:02:24.063 --> 00:02:25.810
Ah, ah!
(board sliding)

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:26.892
(audience laughing)

00:02:26.892 --> 00:02:28.368
Ah! (grunts)
(board sliding)

00:02:28.368 --> 00:02:30.332
