00:02:30.332 --> 00:02:31.670
Ah!
(board thudding)

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:32.503
Son of a bitch!

00:02:32.503 --> 00:02:33.336
(audience laughing)
(board sliding and thudding)

00:02:33.336 --> 00:02:35.503
Ah, (grunting) dah!

00:02:35.503 --> 00:02:38.370
