00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:48.530
Stand up slow, nice and easy.

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:50.290
Yeah, oh yeah!
Get a feel.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.123
Yeah.

00:02:52.058 --> 00:02:52.891
Okay.

00:02:52.891 --> 00:02:53.724
Yeah.
